'''Mega Slowbro ex''' (Japanese: '''メガヤドランex''' ''Mega Yadoran ex'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion.

